[version]
1.6.3
[date]
2026-10-22
[whatsnew]
- FIXED: Editor crash on empty lines (colors.darkGray doesn't exist!)
  - Changed to colors.gray (darkGray is not a valid CC:T color)
- FIXED: Pinestore install now handles "pastebin run <code>" format!
  - install_command can be "wget run https://..." OR "pastebin run yR1dxgcE"
  - Tries 3 strategies: HTTP URL → pastebin run → pastebin get
  - Converts pastebin code to https://pastebin.com/raw/<code> and fetches
- NEW: Pinestore auto-installs to floppy disk when local disk is full!
  - Checks free space before install
  - If < 100KB free AND disk drive with disk is attached:
    - Changes CWD to /disk/ so install script writes there
    - App is installed on the floppy disk
    - Adds app to /etc/apps.conf so it shows in GUI
  - If install fails with "out of space":
    - Suggests inserting a floppy disk and retrying
- NEW: After successful pinestore install, app is auto-added to apps.conf
  - App name and path added to /etc/apps.conf
  - Shows up in GUI desktop icons and Apps menu immediately
[/whatsnew]
[files]
usr/bin/editor.lua
bin/pinestore.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
